    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Spatiotemporal Forecasting as Planning: A Model-Based Reinforcement Learning Approach with Generative <span class="search-hit mathjax">World</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Models</span>
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Wu%2C+H">Hao Wu</a>, 
      
