    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Generative <span class="search-hit mathjax">World</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Modelling</span> for Humanoids: 1X <span class="search-hit mathjax">World</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Model</span> Challenge Technical Report
      
